{"id": 7750080233670, "title": "3 Mode Adjustable Kneading Lactation Massager", "body_html": "<p><strong>Deeply Relieve Blockage</strong>: Referring to the international professional massage method, the Momcozy lactation massager uses 3 powerful rolling massage balls that mimic real hands with circular motions to effectively relieve clogged ducts during pumping or breastfeeding—a true game changer for nursing moms</p>\n<p><strong>3-in-1 Multifunction</strong>: The lactation massager has 12 types of care methods including 3 speeds of rolling, 6 modes of vibration, and 3 levels of heating, from which you can always find the gentlest and most effective mode to dislodge the clogged ducts, help with the engorgement and speed up the letdown process.</p>\n<p><strong>Small But Efficient</strong>: Let go of hot towels, warm compresses, and sore hands, this breast massager is small enough to fit in any bra while helpful a lot with both nursing and when pumping with your breast pump. Shorter pumping time, a Little less hassle!</p>\n<p><strong>Put Mom’s Mind At Ease</strong>: Made of liquid silicone which is food-grade level and BPA-free, the rolling warming lactation massager grides no skin while being very safe for the skin and further the baby. A never-wrong gift for a new mom or mom-to-be.</p>\n<p><strong>Easy To Use</strong>: Only 3 buttons and operable easily with one hand. IPX6 waterproof allows it to be used in the shower and take advantage of massaging under warm water, which also helps loosen stubborn ducts and relieve engorgement. A sleek travel pouch for easy on the go.</p>", "vendor": "Momcozy", "product_type": "Massager", "created_at": "2023-01-30T23:31:17-05:00", "handle": "momcozy-3-in-1-kneading-lactation-massager", "updated_at": "2026-10-13T03:55:03-04:00", "published_at": "2023-01-30T23:31:17-05:00", "template_suffix": "product-lm02-2", "published_scope": "global", "tags": "Breastfeeding supplies, lactation massager, 吸奶器, 吸奶器小品, 哺乳按摩仪, 小品主链", "variants": [{"i